        "zh": "i 也可作关系词；不能仅凭一个 i 就认定是冠词。",
        "en": "i also introduces relative clauses; an isolated i is not necessarily an article."
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "text": "I elda i túla ná vanya.",
          "hl": "i túla",
          "zh": "正在来的那个精灵很美。",
          "en": "The elf who is coming is beautiful."
        },
        {
          "text": "I atan i máta ná alta.",
          "hl": "i máta",
          "zh": "正在吃的那个人类很大。",
          "en": "The human who is eating is large."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
